      "description": "A stable element ID (PLAN.md section 4.1): a layer prefix, a colon, then printable ASCII without spaces.",
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^(doc|usdm|odm|sdtm|adam|ars|ard|cell|decision):[!-~]+$"
    }
  }
